  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa Regulatory Support Programme I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme offers FSD Africa the opportunity to establish a strategic advisory relationship with the SSA capital markets regulators, building on the solid progress made with the Kenyan, Ugandan and Rwandese regulators.  Supporting the development of CMDMPs is fundamentally catalytic, given that without this kind of a strategy, capital markets development in any country would not have a purpose, both for short- and long-term. The development process should also create opportunities for regulators to sensitise a wide range of stakeholders about the benefits of capital markets development.</narrative>
  </description>
